{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is detected and within reach, grab it, check its properties, and do specific task. Move to next location. If not, scan and check again.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    />\"",
